<title>FRANCE: Comptoirs Modernes Q1 sales up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Comptoirs Modernes Q1 sales up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					8,279    up 7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Comptoirs Modernes said in a statement that on a constant structure and currency basis, sales of its Spanish stores rose 14 percent to 482 million francs.</p>
</text>
